      "id": 115087,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-16T20:16:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>While I am not one of the designers myself, this situation has been discussed before. If Wrest the Mind is destroyed, then any of the damage that has yet to be dealt no longer applies.</p><p>So in your scenario, if she redirects the 15 damage to the Electro-Pulse Explosive, thus destroying it and Wrest the Mind with it, then The Visionary will no longer try to deal damage to it or herself.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:47:09.600Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
