      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/7ea924/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-12T22:20:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Because the card says If you do then deal 3 damage to target and redirect The damage should be dealt to yourself before card leaves play. The redirect happens before the target is destroyed so she should still be dealing herself the 3 damage.&nbsp;</p>",
